WEBVTT

00:13.145 --> 00:16.231
<i>To kill Ivy, I need a weapon.</i>

00:17.232 --> 00:20.652
Sulfuric acid, sugar,
and potassium chlorate

00:20.736 --> 00:22.362
can trigger an explosive fire…

00:23.405 --> 00:26.825
I'm glad I didn't trash
my textbooks from junior high.

00:26.908 --> 00:28.660
CHEMISTRY

00:29.494 --> 00:30.620
Yes?

00:31.204 --> 00:34.082
Toshiro, right?
We'll be staying here a while.

00:34.166 --> 00:36.918
Who are you?
What do you mean "staying here"?

00:37.002 --> 00:38.462
Hey, Toshiro.

00:38.545 --> 00:42.466
Two mercenaries are on their way.
I told them to spy on Hikasa.

00:42.549 --> 00:43.967
<i>Lend them your room, okay?</i>

00:44.051 --> 00:44.968
What?

00:45.052 --> 00:48.764
I'm Myan, and this is Graham.
Lemme use your bath.

00:48.847 --> 00:50.557
<i>Be nice, okay?</i>

00:53.059 --> 00:53.894
"Be nice," my ass--

01:09.785 --> 01:14.122
FOOL NIGHT

02:28.530 --> 02:29.447
Crap.

02:35.078 --> 02:37.664
The number of protests
at the Transfloration Board…

02:37.747 --> 02:39.040
Whoa, over there!

02:39.124 --> 02:40.292
Get 'em!

02:40.375 --> 02:41.793
Something's happening!

02:41.877 --> 02:42.794
Lay off!

02:44.212 --> 02:47.299
<i>Now the protestors and riot police</i>
<i>are throwing punches…</i>

02:51.553 --> 02:54.556
Mercenaries you borrowed
from Kunibe's people, right?

02:54.639 --> 02:55.473
Yes.

02:55.557 --> 02:56.725
I'm Takami.

02:56.808 --> 02:57.976
My name is Asada.

02:58.059 --> 02:59.227
Yorutake.

02:59.311 --> 03:04.065
I've gathered you all here today
to discuss a certain document.

03:04.149 --> 03:05.150
Document?

03:05.233 --> 03:07.527
A classified document about Dr. Kudai.

03:08.528 --> 03:12.282
The "Archives" is an organization
storing important transfloration records.

03:12.365 --> 03:14.242
That's where I found these plans.

03:14.326 --> 03:18.538
Joint research
between Transflora Medical and Dr. Kudai

03:18.622 --> 03:20.498
to grow a mobile Spiriflor.

03:21.207 --> 03:23.293
This would become Ivy's prototype.

03:23.877 --> 03:27.672
Actually, 40 years ago, even before
Dr. Kudai partnered with the opposition,

03:27.756 --> 03:31.384
he was working with Transflora Medical
on Ivy research.

03:34.262 --> 03:38.308
But it's all lies.
This is a fake document I fabricated.

03:39.142 --> 03:40.435
Don't scare me like that!

03:40.518 --> 03:41.561
Looks legit.

03:41.645 --> 03:43.438
Even the verification seal.

03:44.105 --> 03:47.817
So, pretty much,
this is bait to lure in the opposition?

03:47.901 --> 03:49.527
Exactly.

03:49.611 --> 03:53.740
This document will guide us
straight to Dr. Kudai.

03:54.658 --> 03:56.493
Let's hear the details.

03:57.077 --> 04:02.123
Our main objective
is to detain Ivy's creator, Dr. Kudai.

04:02.207 --> 04:06.920
Honestly, it would've been quicker
to follow Hikasa to Dr. Kudai's location.

04:07.003 --> 04:09.506
However, Hikasa noticed our spies.

04:09.589 --> 04:12.676
Since then,
he and the opposition have been quiet.

04:12.759 --> 04:17.013
<i>But now, they're aware that</i>
<i>Ivy's information has leaked to us.</i>

04:17.097 --> 04:19.599
<i>They're probably searching for the mole.</i>

04:20.183 --> 04:24.521
So we'll leave this document
at Transflora Medical for them to find.

04:24.604 --> 04:26.231
The opposition will use this

04:26.314 --> 04:29.359
to pin all the blame on Transflora Medical

04:29.442 --> 04:32.279
for causing Ivy's mass murders.

04:32.362 --> 04:35.448
This isn't even "bait."
It's a total feast.

04:35.532 --> 04:36.533
Makes sense.

04:37.117 --> 04:41.579
To publicly expose Transflora Medical
for the crimes mentioned in this document,

04:41.663 --> 04:43.748
Hikasa needs the doctor as a witness

04:43.832 --> 04:47.210
to raise the issue in court
or with the Diet.

04:48.295 --> 04:50.046
That's where we'll catch him.

04:53.842 --> 04:55.468
Isn't this too risky?

04:55.552 --> 04:58.430
What if we fail to secure the doctor?

04:58.513 --> 05:02.142
If that happens,
we'll take an Archives Inspector to court

05:02.225 --> 05:04.978
to prove the document is fake.

05:05.061 --> 05:09.733
If we do that, Transflora Medical
will punish us for document fabrication.

05:09.816 --> 05:14.237
Besides, there's no guarantee
that Hikasa will fall into our trap.

05:14.946 --> 05:17.866
You're right. Our plan has holes.

05:17.949 --> 05:20.535
But we have to do something.

05:21.494 --> 05:24.456
The public is completely uninformed.

05:24.539 --> 05:27.375
Their stress is about to boil over.

05:27.459 --> 05:29.294
Once this explodes…

05:31.129 --> 05:33.548
it'll be out of our control.

05:36.051 --> 05:38.678
I guess it's worth a try.

05:46.644 --> 05:50.065
The challenge is placing this in their lap

05:50.148 --> 05:52.484
without them realizing it's bait.

05:52.567 --> 05:55.779
When they come to steal it,
we need to put up a believable fight.

05:55.862 --> 05:59.949
They're amateurs, right? Piece of cake.
We'll stage a fierce battle.

06:00.033 --> 06:02.035
Don't underestimate them, or you'll die.

06:03.411 --> 06:05.872
One of them is a serious threat.

06:30.897 --> 06:33.399
<i>Still no suspicious activity from Hikasa.</i>

06:33.483 --> 06:35.985
<i>He's not commanding his agents either.</i>

06:36.069 --> 06:39.656
Understood. Please continue surveillance.

06:42.826 --> 06:43.660
TRANSFLORA MEDICAL

06:43.743 --> 06:45.495
<i>It's been a week already.</i>

06:45.578 --> 06:48.164
<i>Are they really not coming?</i>

07:20.405 --> 07:21.239
<i>It's Myan.</i>

07:21.322 --> 07:23.741
Hey. What is it? I'm not doing anything…

07:23.825 --> 07:26.744
<i>What? I don't care, just come quickly.</i>

07:28.371 --> 07:29.998
We're under attack.

07:32.584 --> 07:35.420
It's Tachibana
from the Transfloration Board Archives.

07:35.503 --> 07:39.466
Starting now, Transflora Medical No. 4
will undergo a 20-hour lockdown.

07:39.549 --> 07:43.470
Not a single person
shall be permitted to enter or leave.

07:43.553 --> 07:45.763
We ask for your cooperation

07:45.847 --> 07:48.933
by the authority
of the Transfloration Board Archives!

07:52.187 --> 07:53.688
They're here.

07:53.771 --> 07:54.689
Yes.

07:55.273 --> 07:57.609
Hey, are they all from the opposition?

07:57.692 --> 08:00.236
You didn't say there were this many.

08:01.738 --> 08:04.324
They're not the opposition.

08:04.991 --> 08:07.285
<i>They're the Transfloration Board's</i>
<i>Inspectors.</i>

08:07.368 --> 08:11.998
<i>They monitor Transflora Medical to prevent</i>
<i>misuse of transfloration tech or know-how.</i>

08:12.081 --> 08:14.125
Why are they here?

08:14.209 --> 08:17.128
Clearly, the opposition sent them.

08:17.212 --> 08:19.214
I don't know how, though.

08:20.131 --> 08:22.091
The opposition wants to hide among them

08:22.175 --> 08:25.803
and search Transflora Medical
for a connection between us and Ivy.

08:25.887 --> 08:27.222
That's perfect, right?

08:27.305 --> 08:30.808
That means they're here
to steal the fake document.

08:30.892 --> 08:33.102
Let's plant it somewhere for them to find.

08:33.186 --> 08:34.687
Nope, wrong.

08:34.771 --> 08:38.608
If the Archives' Inspectors
take one look at our fake document,

08:38.691 --> 08:41.027
they'll immediately know it's not theirs.

08:41.611 --> 08:43.571
Then, if the opposition finds out,

08:43.655 --> 08:47.951
that proves Transflora Medical
has no connection to Dr. Kudai.

08:49.410 --> 08:53.414
If that happens,
we'll never be able to bait Hikasa again.

08:53.498 --> 08:56.918
That would forever eliminate
any chance of finding Dr. Kudai.

09:00.797 --> 09:04.425
Right now, we have to make sure
nobody finds our fake document.

09:07.095 --> 09:07.929
Horai!

09:08.012 --> 09:09.013
<i>Chief?</i>

09:09.097 --> 09:11.599
Those Inspectors are chasing me.

09:11.683 --> 09:13.935
I'm a suspect of document theft.

09:14.018 --> 09:16.312
Probably 'cause I went to the Archives…

09:16.396 --> 09:17.313
Chief?

09:17.397 --> 09:19.065
<i>Chief! Are you okay?</i>

09:19.148 --> 09:21.526
Okay, okay! I'll behave!

09:21.609 --> 09:24.028
I only ran away
because you randomly chased me!

09:24.112 --> 09:26.072
Chief Jin Hiragishi.

09:26.906 --> 09:29.659
Care to have a chat with me?

09:30.868 --> 09:33.079
Archivist Tachibana…

09:34.497 --> 09:37.125
Chief Hiragishi has been detained.

09:38.251 --> 09:40.753
I'm his underling,
so they'll target me next.

09:40.837 --> 09:43.172
If we stay together,
they'll just capture us all.

09:44.132 --> 09:46.217
I'll find a separate hiding spot.

09:50.888 --> 09:54.726
This is a custom-made document.
There are no copies.

09:55.560 --> 09:59.063
Please keep it safe
until this inspection ends in 20 hours.

10:05.445 --> 10:08.364
I'm counting on you all as well.

10:10.074 --> 10:11.451
Toshiro, can you hear me?

10:11.534 --> 10:15.204
Are you okay, Yomiko?
I heard things got real serious.

10:15.288 --> 10:17.749
There's no time to explain everything.

10:17.832 --> 10:21.836
The Archives' Inspectors
surrounded Transflora Medical.

10:21.919 --> 10:22.754
Toshiro,

10:22.837 --> 10:25.757
<i>I need you to get a ride</i>
<i>to Transflora Medical and--</i>

10:25.840 --> 10:26.716
Yomiko?

10:34.390 --> 10:37.477
<i>Yomiko? Yomiko? Yomiko!</i>

10:43.858 --> 10:46.903
Please, just stop already!

10:55.870 --> 10:56.996
Enough!

10:57.997 --> 10:58.831
Meg…

11:10.760 --> 11:13.805
For the next 20 hours, we hereby detain

11:14.389 --> 11:16.808
you four "Unsection" employees

11:16.891 --> 11:19.102
from Transflora Medical No. 4's
Control Dept.

11:19.185 --> 11:20.353
What for?

11:20.436 --> 11:25.233
Unsection Chief Jin Hiragishi is suspected
of stealing classified Archive documents.

11:25.316 --> 11:26.317
Chief…

11:26.401 --> 11:27.985
Him again, huh?

11:28.694 --> 11:31.239
Let me out! What if I have to pee?

11:39.956 --> 11:44.335
Excuse us, Deputy Chief Yatsuka.
Please open up. We're here to inspect.

11:45.294 --> 11:47.588
It's an order from the Archives.

12:01.144 --> 12:02.728
I see you two are hard at work.

12:02.812 --> 12:05.064
Your cooperation is much appreciated.

12:05.148 --> 12:08.734
You're not Deputy Chief Yatsuka, though.

12:08.818 --> 12:11.154
I'm his secretary.
The bookshelf's over there--

12:23.791 --> 12:27.128
They hid among the Inspectors
and came straight here to target you.

12:27.211 --> 12:28.796
We need to change locations.

12:36.721 --> 12:38.556
It's only natural to feel scared.

12:39.223 --> 12:41.225
But stay calm.

12:47.231 --> 12:50.151
We're lucky they didn't launch
a rapid-fire attack.

12:50.735 --> 12:53.154
The gun that shot Asada had a silencer.

12:53.237 --> 12:57.492
The opposition can't be flashy
while maneuvering among the Inspectors.

12:57.575 --> 13:02.246
They'll inspect from the ground up.
To escape, we'll need to climb higher.

13:04.832 --> 13:07.251
Why is Akira doing this?

13:08.503 --> 13:10.505
He's not disgusted by this?

13:17.678 --> 13:19.305
How many of you are there?!

13:19.388 --> 13:21.140
Answer me, or I'll kill you!

13:26.312 --> 13:27.647
Te…

13:38.491 --> 13:40.368
You're not in the wrong.

13:46.082 --> 13:48.167
The transfloration room…

13:56.759 --> 13:57.843
How many bullets left?

13:57.927 --> 13:58.970
Fifteen.

13:59.053 --> 14:00.304
Nine.

14:00.388 --> 14:01.806
That's not a lot.

14:02.932 --> 14:04.725
Young Master, get in this locker.

14:04.809 --> 14:09.146
Keep your head down,
and pray that the bullets miss you.

14:09.230 --> 14:10.273
Okay.

14:15.486 --> 14:18.489
You can't come out until I say so.

14:18.573 --> 14:19.657
Kanaeno…

14:24.287 --> 14:25.663
Don't die, okay?

14:28.124 --> 14:29.834
The same goes for you.

15:46.327 --> 15:47.578
Two more.

15:49.080 --> 15:53.417
The Archives' Inspectors
will come flooding in shortly.

15:53.501 --> 15:54.335
You called them?

15:54.418 --> 15:59.048
I sent the Archives a blackmail letter
with random, unreasonable demands

15:59.131 --> 16:03.761
threatening to publicly expose
Dr. Kudai's early research if they refuse.

16:03.844 --> 16:07.223
I left traces of Transflora Medical No. 4
all over it.

16:07.932 --> 16:11.268
Be sure to capture Akira Yatsuka alive.

16:11.352 --> 16:15.439
He's definitely involved
in the kidnapping of our party member.

16:15.523 --> 16:19.652
To pinpoint the leak
and reveal what their objective is,

16:19.735 --> 16:21.612
we'll interrogate him.

16:30.371 --> 16:31.372
That hurt.

16:43.342 --> 16:46.262
Tell me, what are you trying to do?

16:46.345 --> 16:51.767
You're a measly transfloration worker.
Why on earth would you try threatening us?

16:51.851 --> 16:54.145
Like I said, I'm totally clueless.

16:54.729 --> 16:58.149
I'm not trying to replace
the Archives' chief,

16:58.232 --> 17:00.609
and I don't know
the doctor's early research.

17:00.693 --> 17:04.321
But weren't you trying to peek
at Dr. Kudai's classified documents?

17:04.905 --> 17:07.491
Since your authority
wasn't enough the first time,

17:07.575 --> 17:11.871
are you trying to drag down the chief
and loosen the viewing requirements?

17:11.954 --> 17:13.873
What are you talking about?

17:13.956 --> 17:15.875
Stubborn, aren't we?

17:23.424 --> 17:27.762
<i>I can't mention the fake document.</i>
<i>Everything would get leaked.</i>

17:28.345 --> 17:31.098
<i>Even if I spill it all and beg for help,</i>

17:31.182 --> 17:35.102
<i>once they discover Toshiro's ability,</i>
<i>the Transfloration Board will target him.</i>

17:35.186 --> 17:36.353
<i>That'd be disastrous.</i>

17:39.482 --> 17:44.153
You're fighting hard, aren't you?
Okay, let's make a mutual trade.

17:47.156 --> 17:51.869
Tell me your secret, and I'll reveal
the truth of your colleague's death.

18:02.880 --> 18:05.508
I don't care about the past.

18:09.011 --> 18:10.638
I'm betting on the present.

18:11.305 --> 18:14.141
You're not a strong gambler, are you?

18:38.457 --> 18:39.750
Did your lungs collapse?

18:40.334 --> 18:42.962
Good, now I can finally cut you in two.

18:47.967 --> 18:50.427
Is Akira Yatsuka hiding in a locker?

18:58.435 --> 19:00.479
BONE MARROW TRANSPLANT CONSENT FORM

19:22.918 --> 19:26.463
<i>I don't want to be powerless anymore.</i>

19:29.800 --> 19:32.219
<i>I don't want any more loss.</i>

19:34.972 --> 19:37.224
Kanaeno, it's been a while.

19:39.310 --> 19:42.980
<i>I'll protect him even if it costs my life.</i>

19:47.902 --> 19:49.069
<i>Love.</i>

19:49.153 --> 19:51.197
<i>- That's love.</i>
<i>- Love!</i>

19:54.491 --> 19:56.702
<i>Sacrificing oneself for love!</i>

19:59.538 --> 20:01.457
<i>Love becomes one's mission.</i>

20:03.542 --> 20:07.880
<i>Be a warrior,</i>
<i>and serve your one and only savior.</i>

20:19.808 --> 20:22.478
Say goodbye to your lower half.

20:25.648 --> 20:28.484
<i>What's this? It's not even budging…</i>

20:28.567 --> 20:30.236
<i>There's something inside--</i>

21:00.099 --> 21:02.017
Hey! Stop right there!

21:30.504 --> 21:33.048
Kanaeno… Kanaeno!

21:35.217 --> 21:36.302
Kanaeno!

21:36.885 --> 21:38.304
Stay with me!

21:38.887 --> 21:42.433
I didn't say you could come out.

21:43.976 --> 21:44.977
Hey!

21:46.979 --> 21:48.188
Kanaeno!

21:58.866 --> 22:01.243
No way. When did you…

22:01.744 --> 22:05.039
You did the procedure?
What the hell?! When…

22:06.081 --> 22:08.500
You can't be serious…

22:08.584 --> 22:09.918
It's not over.

22:10.794 --> 22:13.213
It hasn't been 20 hours yet.

22:18.093 --> 22:21.096
Save yourself and get out of here.

22:22.639 --> 22:24.350
Take the document…

22:31.065 --> 22:34.276
I'll treat this…

22:36.320 --> 22:37.654
on my own.

22:49.249 --> 22:51.960
Container JZ-3, check complete.

22:52.044 --> 22:53.545
What about 6 and beyond?

22:53.629 --> 22:56.048
Still in storage. I'll retrieve them.

24:41.945 --> 24:46.950
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
